<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Armstrong World said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Armstrong World said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette raised its rating on Armstrong World Industries Inc to outperform from market perform, a trading source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/8 to 63-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
